COMMENT ON COLUMN app_users.role IS 'App role. One of: ''admin'' (full edit/promote rights once Phase 5 lands) or ''member'' (read-only today). Word-level promotion to a finer-grained role table can land later as an additive change.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app_users.notes IS 'Free-text notes — provenance, why-granted, whatever the registry maintainer wants future readers to know.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN app_users.created IS 'Creation timestamp.';

